# Git conventions

- Conventional commits: `feat(m4-plans): add addon price snapshot on renewal`
  — scope is the module id when applicable (m1..m13), otherwise the area
  (infra, ci, docs).
- Branch naming: `feat/m4-renewal-snapshot`, `fix/m11-crm-pipeline-filter`.
- One logical change per commit. Don't bundle an unrelated refactor into a
  feature commit — call it out and suggest splitting instead.
- PR description must state which module (M1–M13) and which PRD section it
  implements, and list any deferred-scope item it deliberately does NOT
  touch (see docs/MVP_ROADMAP.md "Explicitly deferred").
